  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc84:4.1.6": "“Beryl” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>veḷuriya</i>. Sp-ṭ 1.281: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Veḷuriyoti vaṁsavaṇṇamaṇi</i>, “The bamboo-colored gem is called <i lang='pi' translate='no'>veḷuriya</i>.” According to PED <i lang='pi' translate='no'>veḷuriya</i> is lapis lazuli, which cannot be correct because lapis lazuli is blue. ",
